      <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[### Changed

- Clipboard managers such as Paste show DeepSnap as the app that copied, not the app in front.
- Capture Text answers in the middle of the screen: Recognizing, then Text copied with its first words and ⌘Z, or No text found — a click on Text copied shows the text.]]></description>
